@bank all
// Playtest 2 (items 15 and 20, head writer W2): your place in a queue (seat U shows it; X keeps the queue). TEXTS.
// {nth} is "2nd", "3rd".
== queue.booth
- You're {nth} in line for a booth.
== queue.shower
- You're {nth} in line for the showers.
== queue.next
- You're next.
== queue.go
- Your turn.
== queue.left
- You left the line.
